Hi Jerry,

Let me first say this: it is impossible for me/Philip to track the problem down since we don't have any experience with the analysis of Affymetrix arrays using Matlab. We standardly use R/BioC/aroma.affymetrix.
However, I noticed you try to perform gcrma normalization. Since the ST arrays consist of PM probes only, GCRMA normalization won't work. What happens if you try to RMA-normalize your data (using "affyrma" in Matlab)?

Regards,
Guido
